Capability? Not bad compared to MiniMax M2.1, not been using glm these days due to its alwful speed;
Speed? similar to minimax, maybe a little bit faster
Price &amp; limit? Poooooo, 2 or 3 prompts literally consume 60% of limit in 5 hours, it is absolutely not the ideal model in good price, and yet I don't see any performance gap over minimax, so maybe I will turn back to minimax soon



